---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import Board from '../components/BoardPreview.astro';import Notice from '../components/ProcessNotice.astro';import {loadPublicSnapshot,ranked,date} from '../lib/data';import {sitePath} from '../lib/basepath';
const s=loadPublicSnapshot(),low=ranked(s,'low_score_accepted'),high=ranked(s,'high_score_rejected');const p=(url:string)=>sitePath(url,import.meta.env.BASE_URL);const known=s.papers.length>0;const approved=s.papers.filter(x=>['approved','published'].includes(x.report_state||''));
---
<Base active="overview"><div class="page-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">ICLR 2026 · PUBLIC REVIEW RECORDS</div><h1>评分与决定，回到证据。</h1><p>从低分录取与高分拒稿出发，查看原始评分、公开决定和可追溯的分析。</p></div><div class="edition"><b>季度静态版</b><span>手动更新 · 每三个月</span></div></div><div class="status-bar"><span class="pill">{known?'公开材料快照':'数据接入待完成'}</span><span>{known?`采集 ${date(s.manifest.generated_at)}`:'真实数据验收尚未通过 · 当前没有可发布榜单'}</span><a href={p('/data-status/')}>覆盖说明 ↗</a></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="stat-title">已导入公开论文</div><div class="stat-value">{s.papers.length.toLocaleString()}</div><div class="stat-caption">{known?'本期实际取得的记录':'会议总数尚未核定'}</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-title">低分录取 · 可排名</div><div class="stat-value">{known?low.length.toLocaleString():'—'}</div><div class="stat-caption">明确录取 · 至少 3 份有效评分</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-title">高分拒稿 · 可排名</div><div class="stat-value">{known?high.length.toLocaleString():'—'}</div><div class="stat-caption">普通拒稿 · 至少 3 份有效评分</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-title">已批准分析报告</div><div class="stat-value">{s.papers.filter(x=>['approved','published'].includes(x.report_state||'')).length}</div><div class="stat-caption">来源核验与人工审批分别记录</div></div></div><div class="boards"><Board title="低分录取" kind="low-score-accepted" subtitle="Accept · 按有效评分均分升序" items={low}/><Board title="高分拒稿" kind="high-score-rejected" subtitle="Reject · 按有效评分均分降序" items={high}/></div><Notice/><div class="section-title"><h2>证据分析</h2><a href={p('/methodology/#analysis')}>分析与审核方法 →</a></div>{approved.length?<div class="panel">{approved.slice(0,5).map(paper=><p><a class="text-link" href={p('/papers/'+paper.forum_id+'/#analysis')}>{paper.title}</a></p>)}</div>:<div class="analysis-empty"><strong>尚无已批准的报告</strong><p>每份报告将区分公开原文、具体判断与人工复核。没有充分证据的结论保留为“无法判断”。</p></div>}</Base>
